<h2>Information We Access</h2>
<p>
This application uses Google OAuth 2.0 to access
Google Sheets and associated data authorized by
the user.
</p>

<h2>How We Use Information</h2>
<p>
Google Sheets data is processed by our privately
operated n8n automation server to perform
workflows requested by the user.
</p>

<h2>Storage and Security</h2>
<p>
OAuth credentials are stored in the n8n
credential system. Data may be retained in
workflow executions and connected services
according to their configured settings.
We use reasonable security measures to
protect stored information.
</p>

<h2>Sharing</h2>
<p>
We do not sell Google user data or use it
for advertising. Data may be processed by
third-party services specifically configured
by the user in an automation workflow.
</p>

<h2>Data Control</h2>
<p>
Users can revoke Google access through their
Google Account security settings.
Users may also request deletion of stored
data by contacting us.
</p>

<h2>Google API Compliance</h2>
<p>
Our use and transfer of information received
from Google APIs will adhere to the Google
API Services User Data Policy, including
the Limited Use requirements.
</p>

